# An allowlist: the Dockerfile's build context is exactly what the build reads,
# so a local target/, an untracked secret or a stray trace never reaches the
# builder. xtask is a workspace member, so `--locked` resolution needs it even
# though nothing builds it.
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!rust-toolchain.toml
!LICENSE
!crates/
!xtask/
crates/*/*.cdx.json
xtask/*.cdx.json
